Yeah, well, of course you would.

257
00:17:23,040 --> 00:17:24,200
How about you, Sig?

258
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:31,097
I'm heading off on a search
to find him now. Hey? Whoa?

259
00:17:31,180 --> 00:17:34,357
Now I understand your
eagerness but please calm down.

260
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:40,877
Now just to be clear as the sovereign
six we will all raise the boy as a group.

261
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:42,317
You all agree? Yes.

262
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:46,780
Now then let's go find this
young prodigy right away.

263
00:17:56,740 --> 00:17:58,397
Well looky here? Nor?

264
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,310
Hey?

265
00:17:59,393 --> 00:18:01,197
I'm glad you're safe. Yeah?

266
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:04,717
I made it somehow found this
lying on the ground. Oh?

267
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:07,057
It must have flown off in the attack.

268
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:08,317
Thanks a lot.

269
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:09,777
So uh?

270
00:18:09,860 --> 00:18:11,697
Suppose you're well on your way to?

271
00:18:11,780 --> 00:18:12,721
through already.

272
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:16,760
And then you saw what was
happening and came back. Sorta.

273
00:18:16,940 --> 00:18:17,820
I heard the

274
00:18:18,580 --> 00:18:19,717
news and turned around.

275
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:21,017
You're all caked in mud.

276
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:22,537
And your clothes are burnt up.

277
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:23,680
It was a hectic

278
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:25,030
day.

279
00:18:25,113 --> 00:18:26,840
I kind of got into some stuff. Yeah.

280
00:18:27,180 --> 00:18:28,277
Sorry to hear that.

281
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:30,140
I had a pretty bad time too.

282
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:31,230
Everybody

283
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:33,077
here is in the same boat.

284
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:33,990
What a mess.

285
00:18:34,120 --> 00:18:35,477
Man, I am worn out.

286
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:36,520
I'm about that.

287
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:38,120
I hate to do this to

288
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,470
you, kid.

289
00:18:39,553 --> 00:18:40,877
Especially since you're all beat to hell,

290
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:43,877
but the foreman was looking
all over the place for you.

291
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:47,397
He needs you to haul away some rubble
and help build some temporary housing.

292
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:49,517
That's exactly why I came by, actually.

293
00:18:49,600 --> 00:18:50,430
Where

294
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:51,390
is he?

295
00:18:51,473 --> 00:18:53,340
I'll get you a map. One sec.

296
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:02,044
Having you back is a huge help.

297
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:05,397
When you're here, our
progress is off the charts.

298
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:07,539
I'm glad I can still be of service.

299
00:19:10,260 --> 00:19:13,300
Whew, man, what a crazy day.

300
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:19,260
I went on a ride in a
carriage, met a demon folk.

301
00:19:22,360 --> 00:19:24,957
I got to fly with Lin's amazing magic,

302
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:31,380
and then I got to fly
again by Lin's magic.

303
00:19:32,140 --> 00:19:35,757
And some other stuff
happened but flying around

304
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:38,369
all over the place is
what I remember most.

305
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:42,657
I'm gonna need something
to eat and get some rest

306
00:19:42,740 --> 00:19:48,020
soon but no time for that
yet there's work to do.

307
00:19:50,100 --> 00:19:54,017
I'm sure you already figured it
out but the theocracy of Mithra.

308
00:19:54,100 --> 00:19:59,060
Were the ones working behind the scenes
with Doritas on waging this war. I did.

309
00:19:59,280 --> 00:20:03,777
From the Minotaur incident to the Empire's
weaponry, the high-purity monostones,

310
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:08,036
which can only be produced in Mithra,
have been a factor at every turn.

311
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:10,640
I fear our future will not be peaceful.

312
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:17,200
However, there are people
our nation can depend on.

313
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:36,337
And most importantly,

314
00:20:36,420 --> 00:20:41,880
we are blessed to have a new friend.

315
00:20:43,940 --> 00:20:45,680
Oh, boy.

316
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,680
Instructor!

317
00:20:54,060 --> 00:20:56,537
Thank you so much for
everything you did yesterday.

318
00:20:56,620 --> 00:20:58,720
You're a real hero, you know that?

319
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:04,340
I know it was hard for you, but you're
still here, handing out supplies. I am.

320
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:07,717
I've also been treating those
who are injured as well.

321
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:10,057
I see you're helping with the restoration.

322
00:21:10,140 --> 00:21:10,970
Yeah.

323
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:18,560
Well, you are in luck.

324
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:22,249
I'm handing these out to
everybody, so please help yourself.

325
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:24,460
Can I really? By all means.

326
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:26,030
Thanks.

327
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:28,826
I better get back to it then.

328
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:31,220
So goodbye for now. See you soon.

329
00:21:32,280 --> 00:21:33,110
Okay then.

330
00:21:33,193 --> 00:21:34,240
Take care, Lin. Bye!

331
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:36,932
Don't work yourself too hard, instructor.

332
00:21:41,020 --> 00:21:44,549
Man, I wouldn't be where I am
without so many people's help.

333
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,070
Nice!

334
00:21:47,980 --> 00:21:49,960
I can move so much better now.

335
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:53,460
This really is a good, sturdy sword.

336
00:21:54,020 --> 00:21:58,432
It's a shame it won't see very much
flashy action with me holding on to it.

337
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:03,840
But maybe one day, I'll finally
get to be an adventurer.

338
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:08,085
And we can have epic journeys
like the heroes in the storybooks.

339
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:10,080
The ones like Dad read to me.

340
00:22:11,600 --> 00:22:15,740
But for the time being, I'll
put you to good use here. Nord!

341
00:22:17,460 --> 00:22:19,637
We've cleared out enough in this area!

342
00:22:19,720 --> 00:22:21,597
Are you good to keep working elsewhere?

343
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:23,640
Yeah, sure, no problem.

344
00:22:29,860 --> 00:22:30,690
Harry!

345
00:22:47,700 --> 00:22:48,617
Oh well.

346
00:22:48,700 --> 00:22:51,840
Well, I guess this is where
we really belong anyway.

347
00:23:18,700 --> 00:23:20,697
I love you, I love you.

348
00:23:20,780 --> 00:23:22,133
I love you, I love you.

349
00:23:24,700 --> 00:23:28,880
I love you, I love you. Give me.
